<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were unevenly steady. Demand moderate on a light to moderate movement.</p>
<p>Top $61.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>			   Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs. 58.50-60.00	     59.50-61.00</p>
<p>		     Few 58.00 &amp; 60.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs. 54.00-58.00</p>
<p>	  210-230 lbs. 49.50-54.00</p>
<p>Sows, Near Steady. Top 53.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 44.00-46.00</p>
<p>	  450-500 lbs. 45.50-48.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 47.50-52.00</p>
<p>Few over 600 lbs. 52.00-53.00</p>
